<title>USA: Wellspring buys SLM Int'l stake.</title>
<headline>Wellspring buys SLM Int'l stake.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private investment firm Wellspring Associates LLC said it will buy a major equity stake in SLM International Inc, a manufacturer and marketer of ice and roller hockey equipment.</p>
<p>SLM International, which filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy in October 1995, received confirmation of its reorganization plan late Thursday.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212/859-1700))</p>
